  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Blume Fund V</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Blume Ventures GIFT Fund V (Fund V or the Fund) is targeted to be a US$300 million, India focused venture capital (VC) fund. The Fund aims to invest in the software as-a-service (SaaS), B2B marketplaces, climate tech, agritech, healthtech, edtech, and fintech sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected development impact through: (i) Increased access to early-stage venture capital financing and value creation services for companies in India; (ii) Improving market competitiveness in real and financial sectors in India, by catalyzing market-wide innovation through the expansion of investees with innovative business models, via demonstration, replication and/or competition/innovation channels.</narrative>
  </description>
